  "releaseNotes": "Stable 3.0.0: managed IPF decoding with density selectors, per-cell timing weights, stored gap streams and weak/no-flux regions; read-only SCP decoding; aggregate loader options; hardfile configuration and partition metadata. Compared with stable 2.1.0, AmigaEncodedTrack.WrapBitOffset is internal and custom IWritableAmigaSectorDiskMedia implementations must provide TryWriteBytes. Standard ADF synthetic revolutions remain 6334 MFM words.",
